---
description: Python style for Astraq ML service
globs: services/ml/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Typing
- All public functions fully typed. `from __future__ import annotations` in every module.
- Prefer `Annotated[...]` with `pydantic.Field` for FastAPI schemas.
- No `Any` without a comment explaining why.

# Structure
- `app/api/` routers, `app/core/` config+logging, `app/data/` loaders, `app/features/`, `app/models/`, `app/backtest/`.
- Routers are thin; call service functions in `app/services/`.

# Errors
- Raise `HTTPException` only in routers. Internal code raises domain exceptions (`DataNotFoundError`, `ModelNotReadyError`) mapped by a FastAPI exception handler.

# Config
- Use `pydantic-settings`. Fail fast on missing env. No `os.environ.get` scattered in code.
